1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,652
Reach your hands out,

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:06,913
cut through the wind,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,130
and forge ahead, drawing your own map as you go!

4
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:19,565
We can't even tell left from right

5
00:00:19,608 --> 00:00:22,782
in this tempest-tossed era

6
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,043
Even the values we've honed

7
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:29,390
seem ready to crumble

8
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:32,652
Is the compass leading us true,

9
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,869
or is it leading us astray?

10
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:39,217
Nobody knows for sure!

11
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:45,652
Just breathe deep, close your eyes

12
00:00:45,739 --> 00:00:52,696
and you'll find your soul guiding the way!

13
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,913
Reach your hands out,

14
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:59,174
cut through the wind,

15
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:04,043
and kick away the darkness!

16
00:01:05,086 --> 00:01:08,129
I'm doing this for myself,

17
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:12,260
and you're doing this for yourself too, right?

18
00:01:12,347 --> 00:01:17,347
Forge ahead, painting the world in your own colors!

19
00:01:24,086 --> 00:01:25,782
Sanji!

20
00:01:25,782 --> 00:01:28,956
Stay focused!
Behind you!

21
00:01:28,957 --> 00:01:31,174
Ya little runt!

22
00:01:38,304 --> 00:01:39,434
Ouch.

23
00:01:50,391 --> 00:01:51,913
Whaaaa?!

24
00:01:51,913 --> 00:01:54,826
Queen-sama's blade
just snapped right off!

25
00:01:54,826 --> 00:01:57,826
He definitely hit him
in the neck, right?

26
00:01:57,826 --> 00:02:02,739
How did he break that sword with his neck?
You're amazing, Sanji!

27
00:02:02,739 --> 00:02:06,435
Armament Haki?
Whatever it was, that's impossible!

28
00:02:06,435 --> 00:02:10,435
You didn't use Haki, did you?

29
00:02:10,478 --> 00:02:13,956
Germa's got some
serious scientific muscle, don't they?

30
00:02:16,086 --> 00:02:18,434
What's the deal with this?!

31
00:02:27,782 --> 00:02:30,695
Your body's fascinating!

32
00:02:30,696 --> 00:02:34,000
I remember what Judge once said
like it was yesterday:

33
00:02:37,869 --> 00:02:40,391
"Give humans exoskeletons!"

34
00:02:41,217 --> 00:02:43,434
"Give them extraordinary
healing abilities!"

35
00:02:46,304 --> 00:02:48,608
"Give them physical strength!"

36
00:02:50,174 --> 00:02:55,000
"And give them
unfeeling hearts of ice!"

37
00:02:55,435 --> 00:02:57,217
I'm so very sorry!

38
00:02:57,782 --> 00:03:00,478
I've served you something
that did not suit your taste, Niji-sama!

39
00:03:10,217 --> 00:03:13,000
Tryin' to leave a mark
on a lady's face, huh?!

40
00:03:15,217 --> 00:03:16,695
No, I...

41
00:03:17,739 --> 00:03:21,913
...don't want to become
one of those heartless monsters!

42
00:03:21,957 --> 00:03:24,783
But you are a monster!

43
00:03:24,826 --> 00:03:28,912
Welcome to this monster world!

44
00:03:31,782 --> 00:03:34,652
Black Light Roast!

45
00:03:37,782 --> 00:03:39,652
Wait a minute, dammit!

46
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:45,174
What the hell's
happening to my body?!

47
00:03:49,260 --> 00:03:51,999
I need some time to process this!

48
00:03:52,608 --> 00:03:55,695
Think back!
What've I done up 'til now?!

49
00:03:58,869 --> 00:04:01,043
Who the hell are you?!

50
00:04:04,521 --> 00:04:06,304
Sangoro!

51
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,783
Is it because
I transformed into Soba Mask?

52
00:04:10,478 --> 00:04:11,130
No way!

53
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:15,826
Am I seriously losing who I am?!

54
00:04:17,086 --> 00:04:18,825
Sanji's...

55
00:04:18,826 --> 00:04:20,956
...been acting real funny...

56
00:04:20,957 --> 00:04:23,826
That's one of the Straw Hats!

57
00:04:23,826 --> 00:04:26,347
Queen-san's got him cornered!

58
00:04:26,347 --> 00:04:28,260
He's mumbling something...

59
00:04:28,260 --> 00:04:30,869
This's our chance!
Shoot to kill!

60
00:04:34,130 --> 00:04:37,913
You're done,
Black-Leg Sanji!

61
00:04:41,086 --> 00:04:42,782
yeah!
Got im!

62
00:04:42,782 --> 00:04:43,869
Ya-hoo!

63
00:04:52,260 --> 00:04:54,347
That hurt, ya know!

64
00:04:54,347 --> 00:04:56,651
Whaaaa?!

65
00:05:02,217 --> 00:05:04,782
That's one tooough exoskeleton!

66
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:10,565
Put on your combat suit!

67
00:05:10,608 --> 00:05:13,521
Show me more
of Germa's science!

68
00:05:13,565 --> 00:05:17,912
I got nothin' to do with those bastards!
Don't lump me in with them!

69
00:05:24,260 --> 00:05:27,912
I'm betting you're a Navy spy.

70
00:05:28,391 --> 00:05:31,217
But in this case,
it doesn't matter...

71
00:05:31,435 --> 00:05:35,391
The real question is,
do you or don't you wanna take down Kaido?

72
00:05:37,696 --> 00:05:39,782
When this battle is over,

73
00:05:39,782 --> 00:05:42,652
the winners're gonna be
on their last legs!

74
00:05:42,652 --> 00:05:46,348
Won't be hard to finish 'em off then!

75
00:05:56,174 --> 00:05:57,521
Whaddya think?

76
00:05:57,521 --> 00:06:02,173
Wanna pal around with us and take everything
for ourselves after all's said and done?

77
00:06:03,217 --> 00:06:05,782
Kaido's army, the rebel army...

78
00:06:05,782 --> 00:06:11,043
Since we're part of neither side,
we don't got reason to be at each other's throats!

79
00:06:13,260 --> 00:06:14,825
I'm amazed...

80
00:06:14,869 --> 00:06:17,782
You really think
I'd trust a coward like you?

81
00:06:17,782 --> 00:06:20,999
You're hardly to be trusted yourself!

82
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:24,565
I'm telling you this because
I think there's benefits in it for you!

83
00:06:24,957 --> 00:06:26,522
You're not gonna get...

84
00:06:27,391 --> 00:06:30,435
...another opportunity like this!

85
00:06:41,130 --> 00:06:42,913
Why do you laugh?

86
00:06:42,913 --> 00:06:47,739
I took you for the sort
that doesn't laugh much...

87
00:06:51,347 --> 00:06:55,304
You didn't...
You ate a Smile Fruit, didn't you?!

88
00:07:07,696 --> 00:07:10,478
You have the greatest
misfortune, Killer!

89
00:07:10,478 --> 00:07:12,478
Hey, look!

90
00:07:12,478 --> 00:07:13,348
Killer-san!

91
00:07:14,521 --> 00:07:15,565
You guys!

92
00:07:15,565 --> 00:07:17,695
Basil Hawkins!

93
00:07:17,696 --> 00:07:19,913
Kaido's stinkin' lapdog!

94
00:07:19,913 --> 00:07:22,217
How could you betray us?!

95
00:07:23,260 --> 00:07:25,695
Please...!
Don't!

96
00:07:27,304 --> 00:07:31,260
Lay a hand on him
and I'll make sure you regret it!

97
00:07:31,260 --> 00:07:35,347
Killer-san, why won't you
let us help out?!

98
00:07:40,869 --> 00:07:43,999
Your captain is my hostage.

99
00:07:45,130 --> 00:07:49,000
It appears he's fighting
Big Mom now...

100
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:52,261
A losing prospect for him,
if you ask me.

101
00:07:53,957 --> 00:07:58,261
As it is, there are few fates
that remain available to you.

102
00:08:04,130 --> 00:08:05,739
Killer-san!

103
00:08:06,739 --> 00:08:08,347
So frustrating!

104
00:08:08,347 --> 00:08:13,043
The fire's closing in, too!
We gotta get outta here, and fast!

105
00:08:17,478 --> 00:08:20,435
Master!

106
00:08:20,739 --> 00:08:23,782
We rescued Komachiyo!

107
00:08:31,304 --> 00:08:34,260
Hurry, or the fire's
gonna swallow us!

108
00:08:43,304 --> 00:08:45,651
It's a monster!

109
00:08:45,652 --> 00:08:48,739
A monster of the lower half variety!

110
00:08:48,739 --> 00:08:51,522
Somebody, lend me aid-poo!

111
00:08:52,435 --> 00:08:53,260
Uh?!

112
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:54,477
Huuuuh?!

113
00:08:54,826 --> 00:08:58,260
Someone, anyone-poooo!

114
00:08:58,304 --> 00:09:01,130
Wait, wait!
What the heck are you doing?!

115
00:09:01,217 --> 00:09:04,130
I require assistance-poo!

116
00:09:04,217 --> 00:09:07,652
That's why I need you to wait!

117
00:09:07,739 --> 00:09:10,565
Who goes there-poo?!
I be Kin'emon-poo!

118
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:13,391
Calm down!
Just calm down!

119
00:09:14,174 --> 00:09:16,174
He ain't a monster, then?

120
00:09:16,174 --> 00:09:17,826
A human?

121
00:09:17,826 --> 00:09:19,391
That's human?

122
00:09:19,478 --> 00:09:23,130
I seek my allies-poo!

123
00:09:23,174 --> 00:09:26,043
And I'm one of them,
Kin'emon!

124
00:09:26,086 --> 00:09:28,303
It's me!
Usopp!

125
00:09:28,304 --> 00:09:30,390
Unhand me-poo!

126
00:09:30,478 --> 00:09:34,174
There is no time to poose!

127
00:09:34,652 --> 00:09:36,739
Whoa, talk about blood loss!

128
00:09:37,565 --> 00:09:39,391
Are you okay?!

129
00:09:39,391 --> 00:09:42,391
Usopp, he can't hear us!

130
00:09:42,391 --> 00:09:44,174
His ears are on his other half!

131
00:09:44,174 --> 00:09:45,521
Oh, yeah!

132
00:09:45,521 --> 00:09:47,999
But we gotta let him know
it's us, somehow!

133
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:51,304
Who goes there?!
Identify yourselves-poo!

134
00:09:51,304 --> 00:09:53,999
How is he talking?

135
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,000
His farts.

136
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:57,000
Guess that's one of
Kin'emon's specialties,

137
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:57,782
HuhB

138
00:09:57,782 --> 00:09:58,565
Farts!!

139
00:09:58,565 --> 00:10:01,043
What an amazing skill!

140
00:10:04,782 --> 00:10:06,086
Worth a shot...
Boop!

141
00:10:12,086 --> 00:10:17,086
Was that the reverse crescent moon?!
Then you be an ally of mine-poo!

142
00:10:17,086 --> 00:10:17,738
All right!

143
00:10:17,739 --> 00:10:19,130
He got it!

144
00:10:19,130 --> 00:10:21,608
Then, I've a request
to ask of poo...

145
00:10:21,608 --> 00:10:26,304
One of my companions yet breathes,
however faint...

146
00:10:27,304 --> 00:10:30,608
Please, do whatever
you can to aid her!

147
00:10:41,608 --> 00:10:43,521
We're borrowing Hamlet!

148
00:10:43,521 --> 00:10:44,912
You guys take care of Tama!

149
00:10:49,869 --> 00:10:55,086
My goodness!
Everybody needs me!

150
00:10:55,086 --> 00:10:57,043
Thank poo!

151
00:10:57,086 --> 00:10:59,695
I know not who you be,
but you be an ally of mine!

152
00:10:59,696 --> 00:11:04,435
In the left tower on the castle's first floor
lies an entrance to a crawl space!

153
00:11:04,478 --> 00:11:06,521
Leave it to me!

154
00:11:17,435 --> 00:11:20,521
What the hell's up
with this pain?!

155
00:11:24,435 --> 00:11:25,956
Hey, what's wrong with you?!

156
00:11:28,782 --> 00:11:31,999
What's your deal?
Got a migraine...

157
00:11:32,696 --> 00:11:34,043
...Kid?

158
00:11:34,043 --> 00:11:35,086
Dammit!

159
00:11:35,086 --> 00:11:36,390
Let's go, Hera!

160
00:11:36,391 --> 00:11:38,304
Yes, Mama!

161
00:11:38,826 --> 00:11:39,912
Napoleon!

162
00:11:39,913 --> 00:11:41,304
Yes, Mama!

163
00:11:41,304 --> 00:11:44,086
If it's hurting that bad,

164
00:11:44,086 --> 00:11:48,173
how about I rêlieve your head
from your shoulders!

165
00:11:48,174 --> 00:11:49,913
Combine!

166
00:11:52,260 --> 00:11:53,912
Thank me later!

167
00:11:54,435 --> 00:11:57,304
What is your problem?!
You're useless, you know that?!

168
00:11:57,696 --> 00:11:59,435
You're in my way, you quack!

169
00:12:01,043 --> 00:12:02,738
Chambres!

170
00:12:03,739 --> 00:12:05,522
Counter Shock!

171
00:12:08,043 --> 00:12:09,390
Mama!

172
00:12:09,478 --> 00:12:11,391
You'll pay for that!

173
00:12:12,174 --> 00:12:14,869
Stolen Feuer!

174
00:12:33,608 --> 00:12:36,304
Mama-Raid!

175
00:12:48,174 --> 00:12:51,086
A ballsy idiot's head,

176
00:12:51,086 --> 00:12:53,086
or a quack's arm...

177
00:12:53,086 --> 00:12:55,999
Which one do I take first?

178
00:13:02,043 --> 00:13:03,869
Dammit all to hell...

179
00:13:03,869 --> 00:13:06,956
I'm finally going toe-to-toe
with an Empress of the Sea!

180
00:13:07,391 --> 00:13:09,913
If I die here, what was...

181
00:13:09,913 --> 00:13:12,565
...the point of living
the pirate life?!

182
00:13:20,521 --> 00:13:23,260
You crack me up,

183
00:13:23,260 --> 00:13:24,912
Kid!

184
00:13:30,826 --> 00:13:32,086
Eustasser!

185
00:13:32,086 --> 00:13:35,999
You look like you could keel over
without my help!

186
00:13:56,304 --> 00:13:57,173
Stop!

187
00:13:57,174 --> 00:13:59,652
Stop it, Hawkins!

188
00:14:00,521 --> 00:14:02,695
You're pathetic, Killer.

189
00:14:02,696 --> 00:14:03,391
Don't!

190
00:14:13,478 --> 00:14:14,739
This sucks...!

191
00:14:15,260 --> 00:14:17,999
What the hell is
going on with me?!

192
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:20,783
Let Kid go!

193
00:14:29,043 --> 00:14:30,129
In return...

194
00:14:32,086 --> 00:14:34,129
...you can have...

195
00:14:34,130 --> 00:14:35,739
...my life!

196
00:14:40,957 --> 00:14:42,261
Killer-san!

197
00:14:44,652 --> 00:14:48,130
Once Kid is no more,
life will be easier for you.

198
00:14:48,130 --> 00:14:53,478
The extent of your misery
can be traced back to him.

199
00:14:55,435 --> 00:14:58,260
You don't get it, do you,

200
00:14:58,260 --> 00:15:00,173
Hawkins?

201
00:15:00,478 --> 00:15:03,174
Kid's gonna put
the Four Emperors to shame...

202
00:15:03,174 --> 00:15:05,608
...and become the Pirate King!

203
00:15:10,478 --> 00:15:12,304
Stop it already!

204
00:15:16,782 --> 00:15:20,826
Hunt down the Four Emperors?
Be the Pirate King?

205
00:15:20,826 --> 00:15:23,565
How admirable,
having such grand ambitions!

206
00:15:27,435 --> 00:15:29,608
Don't get in our way, then!

207
00:15:29,608 --> 00:15:34,130
If I'm in your way,
then cut me down with your scythes!

208
00:15:38,739 --> 00:15:41,391
Or you can surrender,
makes no difference to me.

209
00:15:41,391 --> 00:15:44,695
I'll even put in a word
for you with Kaido-san.

210
00:15:48,174 --> 00:15:51,739
Are you asking me to work for Kaido?

211
00:15:52,304 --> 00:15:55,173
That's low, even for you...

212
00:16:00,260 --> 00:16:01,304
Silence!

213
00:16:01,304 --> 00:16:05,521
At any rate, this is a battle
you and your ilk cannot win!

214
00:16:05,608 --> 00:16:07,478
You've seen how
harsh reality is, aye?

215
00:16:08,304 --> 00:16:12,130
Now you know the reasons
behind their lengthy rule of these seas!

216
00:16:12,130 --> 00:16:15,739
I know your animal instincts
are telling you

217
00:16:15,739 --> 00:16:17,478
"There's no way I can win!"

218
00:16:20,696 --> 00:16:22,522
Go ahead, keep barkin'...

219
00:16:23,608 --> 00:16:25,912
You're regretting it, ain't ya?

220
00:16:26,869 --> 00:16:29,391
The choice you made back then.

221
00:16:31,826 --> 00:16:36,347
Come work for me,
and you'll get a warm welcome...

222
00:16:36,347 --> 00:16:38,434
Turn me down, and...

223
00:16:42,086 --> 00:16:45,260
Regretting it 'cause you were scared
of dying in this future,

224
00:16:45,260 --> 00:16:48,304
but here we are, still kicking!

225
00:16:50,608 --> 00:16:55,217
You will soon know which of us
regrets their decision!

226
00:16:55,217 --> 00:16:56,956
Sure, buddy...

227
00:16:58,565 --> 00:17:00,043
Then I think...

228
00:17:00,478 --> 00:17:03,391
I'll just live without regrets!

229
00:17:03,435 --> 00:17:04,913
Sink or swim!

230
00:17:17,174 --> 00:17:18,652
You're just wearing
yourself out!

231
00:17:21,608 --> 00:17:24,391
See you in hell,
you worthless cub!

232
00:17:29,304 --> 00:17:31,608
Two questions for you:

233
00:17:37,174 --> 00:17:41,565
What happens if you take damage...

234
00:17:41,608 --> 00:17:43,565
...but it's got nowhere to go?

235
00:17:44,260 --> 00:17:46,173
What are you on about?!

236
00:17:46,174 --> 00:17:49,347
You know how my powers work!

237
00:17:49,347 --> 00:17:52,912
Kid receives all damage I take...

238
00:17:53,521 --> 00:17:58,347
...as long as his straw doll
is stored within my body!

239
00:17:58,347 --> 00:18:00,564
That so?

240
00:18:25,782 --> 00:18:29,521
Why?!
You severed my arm!

241
00:18:29,521 --> 00:18:31,608
But all damage must...!

242
00:18:32,391 --> 00:18:33,478
Kid...

243
00:18:33,913 --> 00:18:36,826
...has no left arm!

244
00:18:42,217 --> 00:18:45,043
Drat!
I did not foresee this!

245
00:18:48,347 --> 00:18:50,390
So, question number two...

246
00:18:53,696 --> 00:18:58,261
If I take this away,
how many more lives do you have left?

247
00:19:10,435 --> 00:19:13,565
Congratulations!
That's the last one.

248
00:19:15,043 --> 00:19:18,390
The pain's... gone,
just like that?

249
00:19:22,347 --> 00:19:24,434
Straw Man's Cards!

250
00:19:24,435 --> 00:19:28,478
Death, Upright.
The card of destruction!

251
00:19:54,826 --> 00:19:56,347
Guillotine Claws!

252
00:19:58,913 --> 00:20:00,435
The Strawman's been...!

253
00:20:06,130 --> 00:20:08,739
The Strawman won't die!

254
00:20:08,739 --> 00:20:11,217
If it is in the cards,
it will return!

255
00:20:11,217 --> 00:20:13,782
Reveal to us the outcome
of this battle!

256
00:20:20,435 --> 00:20:21,782
The Tower!

257
00:20:26,347 --> 00:20:28,130
Spin & Sonic!

258
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:49,478
Way to go!
Killer-san!

259
00:20:58,957 --> 00:21:02,000
Hawkins-san!

260
00:21:03,260 --> 00:21:06,304
Straw Man's Cards:
The Tower...

261
00:21:14,652 --> 00:21:16,696
It represents...

262
00:21:20,957 --> 00:21:23,174
"The collapse of the old"...

263
00:21:26,435 --> 00:21:30,695
What's this, now?
All better now, are we...

264
00:21:30,696 --> 00:21:32,304
Kid?

265
00:21:33,130 --> 00:21:36,130
Yeah...
Feels like a load off my shoulders.

266
00:21:39,652 --> 00:21:41,609
Its hidden meaning:

267
00:21:42,435 --> 00:21:44,521
"A new path."

268
00:21:56,347 --> 00:21:59,086
Get goin', partner!

269
00:22:12,739 --> 00:22:14,043
A bit longer...

270
00:22:14,391 --> 00:22:15,956
Endure for just a little bit longer...

271
00:22:15,957 --> 00:22:17,130
Kiku!

272
00:22:17,782 --> 00:22:20,565
I have just made contact
with our allies...

273
00:22:21,521 --> 00:22:22,738
Still...

274
00:22:23,435 --> 00:22:28,043
I could scarcely believe that I was still alive
even after being cleaved in twain!

275
00:22:28,869 --> 00:22:33,478
I suppose when Law-dono cut my body in half,
it was never properly reattached...

276
00:22:33,957 --> 00:22:35,521
A miracle!

277
00:22:35,521 --> 00:22:37,608
Now if only...

278
00:22:37,608 --> 00:22:42,391
If only Kiku can be...
saved... somehow...

279
00:22:47,086 --> 00:22:47,956
Hey...

280
00:22:48,478 --> 00:22:52,131
Hey!

281
00:22:53,304 --> 00:22:56,217
Answer me, Kanjuro!

282
00:22:57,608 --> 00:23:01,738
Hey!
Can you hear me, Kanjuro?!

283
00:23:01,739 --> 00:23:03,043
It cannot be!

284
00:23:03,043 --> 00:23:05,564
Why do I hear Orochi's voice?

285
00:23:05,608 --> 00:23:09,478
I am certain I beheaded him,
with my own hands!

286
00:23:11,086 --> 00:23:14,956
And Kanjuro is already...!

287
00:23:15,696 --> 00:23:17,696
Hey, Kanjuro!

288
00:23:19,913 --> 00:23:23,391
Yes, Orochi-sama...

289
00:23:24,696 --> 00:23:28,174
Barely breathing,
I see, Kanjuro...

290
00:23:31,347 --> 00:23:35,043
I... I must say that this is...

291
00:23:35,043 --> 00:23:38,260
...the end of my performance...

292
00:23:38,260 --> 00:23:41,695
Aye!
My hat's off to you, sir!

293
00:23:41,696 --> 00:23:44,217
An outstanding performance, it was!

294
00:23:47,130 --> 00:23:51,565
I appreciate your kind words
more than anything...

295
00:23:51,565 --> 00:23:54,869
Kanjuro, do you hear them?!

296
00:23:54,869 --> 00:23:58,478
The cheers for you?!

297
00:23:59,521 --> 00:24:03,565
F-For me?

298
00:24:13,478 --> 00:24:14,869
Kurozumi!

299
00:24:19,696 --> 00:24:23,913
Yet I remain frustrated...

300
00:24:23,913 --> 00:24:26,304
Resentful!

301
00:24:26,957 --> 00:24:28,435
Indeed...

302
00:24:29,130 --> 00:24:30,434
Our ancestors...

303
00:24:31,086 --> 00:24:33,782
...await...

304
00:24:33,782 --> 00:24:37,478
...a spectacular encore!

305
00:24:37,478 --> 00:24:40,521
Paint it for me, Kanjuro!

306
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:44,174
The Kurozumi Clan's
burning grudge!

307
00:24:47,435 --> 00:24:50,695
Who shall be the winner?!

308
00:25:05,957 --> 00:25:09,435
The deep-seated wrath of
the Kurozumi Clan...

309
00:25:09,435 --> 00:25:12,130
...shall parade through this castle,

310
00:25:12,130 --> 00:25:13,782
and at last!

311
00:25:13,782 --> 00:25:17,608
It shall...
it shall walk unto the abyss,

312
00:25:17,608 --> 00:25:23,651
and the nadir where it reaches an impasse
shall serve as our graveyard!

313
00:25:23,652 --> 00:25:27,347
Bring solace to our spirits,

314
00:25:27,347 --> 00:25:30,434
Kanjuro!

315
00:25:30,435 --> 00:25:31,521
As you wish.

316
00:25:43,521 --> 00:25:46,651
I shall display for you...

317
00:25:46,652 --> 00:25:49,913
...Kurozumi Kanjuro's
final performance!

318
00:25:50,435 --> 00:25:54,391
Kurozumi Mass Suicide:
Swift Finale!

319
00:25:55,260 --> 00:25:57,260
Kazenbo!

320
00:26:03,478 --> 00:26:06,260
We're gonna burn alive!

321
00:26:06,260 --> 00:26:08,173
M... Monster!

322
00:26:23,435 --> 00:26:24,521
Reporting in!

323
00:26:25,521 --> 00:26:29,912
A giant spectre of unknown origin has appeared
on the second floor of the castle interior!

324
00:26:31,174 --> 00:26:36,000
The specter is passing through the walls
like some kind of ghost!

325
00:26:45,086 --> 00:26:48,043
The castle has turned
into an inferno!

326
00:26:58,086 --> 00:27:02,303
It's time, time, time,
time to show me...

327
00:27:03,435 --> 00:27:06,347
...Germa's suuuu-it!

328
00:27:06,347 --> 00:27:08,086
Stupid freakin' lizard...

329
00:27:08,086 --> 00:27:10,782
I'm sick of hearing you
talk about that!

330
00:27:26,696 --> 00:27:28,652
That's it, then...

331
00:27:29,130 --> 00:27:30,739
Time to go, everyone!

332
00:27:31,130 --> 00:27:32,913
This is no time for fighting!

333
00:27:33,565 --> 00:27:37,478
You're right...
Before the flames cut off our retreat!

334
00:27:50,478 --> 00:27:53,956
Allies of the Kozuki...

335
00:28:14,869 --> 00:28:17,434
Rulers of the sea...

336
00:28:25,782 --> 00:28:28,695
Pride goeth...

337
00:28:29,304 --> 00:28:31,651
...before a fall!

338
00:28:33,957 --> 00:28:36,522
Blast Breath!

339
00:28:46,304 --> 00:28:48,434
Gum-Gum...

340
00:28:49,869 --> 00:28:52,956
...Red Hawk!